  "description": "Tokyo Pattern is a vibrant and eye-catching display font inspired by traditional Japanese wave motifs. Each letter is intricately filled with a seamless pattern that evokes the charm of Tokyo’s iconic aesthetics—blending cultural elegance with playful modernity.\nPerfect for branding, posters, packaging, event graphics, stationery, or social media, this font brings a touch of artistic flair and East Asian character to any project. Whether you're designing for themed events, travel content, or bold visual identities, Tokyo Pattern delivers a unique fusion of style and tradition that stands out with every letter.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Tokyo Pattern</strong> is a vibrant and eye-catching display font inspired by traditional Japanese wave motifs. Each letter is intricately filled with a seamless pattern that evokes the charm of Tokyo’s iconic aesthetics—blending cultural elegance with playful modernity.</p>\n<p>Perfect for branding, posters, packaging, event graphics, stationery, or social media, this font brings a touch of artistic flair and East Asian character to any project. Whether you're designing for themed events, travel content, or bold visual identities, <strong>Tokyo Pattern</strong> delivers a unique fusion of style and tradition that stands out with every letter.</p>",
